  "job_B8.4.2.3.1_20251003_114834": {
    "text": "\u00d0is godspel gebyra\u00f0 on middesumeres m\u00e6sse\u00e6fen.\n\u00d0is sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g to \u00feam ymbrene \u00e6r mydda wyntran.\n\u00d0is gebyra\u00f0 on friged\u00e6g to \u00feam ylcan f\u00e6stene.\n\u00d0is gebyra\u00f0 on mydsumeres m\u00e6ssed\u00e6g.\n\u00d0is sceal on mydde wyntres m\u00e6ssennyht to \u00fe\u00e6re forman m\u00e6ssan.\n\u00d0is sceal on \u00feone ehto\u00f0an m\u00e6ssed\u00e6g to myddan wyntra.\n\u00d0is sceal on \u00feone sunnand\u00e6g betweox mydde wintres m\u00e6ssed\u00e6ge and twelftan d\u00e6ge.\n\u00d0is gebyra\u00f0 on s\u00e6ternd\u00e6g to \u00e6wf\u00e6stene \u00e6r myddan wyntra.\n\u00d0is sceal on \u00feone \u00feryddan \u00feunresd\u00e6g innan lenctene and to pentecosten on s\u00e6ternesd\u00e6g.\n\u00d0is sceal on \u00feone syxtan sunnand\u00e6g ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0is sceal on friged\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re pentecostenes wucan.\n\u00d0is gebyra\u00f0 on \u00feone fiftan sunnand\u00e6g ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys sceal on \u00feone seofenteo\u00f0an sunnand\u00e6g ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0is godspel sceal to \u00feam ymbrene innan h\u00e6rfeste on friged\u00e6g.\n\u00d0is sceal on friged\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re pentecostenes wucan to \u00feam ymbrene.\n\u00d0ys sceal on \u00feunresd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re pentecostenes wucan.\n\u00d0is sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re pentecostenes wucan to \u00feam ymbrene.\n\u00d0is godspel sceal to anes apostoles m\u00e6ssan.\n\u00d0is sceal on \u00fe\u00e6re feowerteo\u00f0an wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0is sceal to assumptione Sancte Marie and s\u00e6terndagum be Maria.\n\u00d0is sceal to gangdagon \u00fe\u00e6ge iii twegen dagas.\n\u00d0is godspel gebyra\u00f0 on \u00feone \u00feryddan sunnand\u00e6g innan lenctene.\n\u00d0is godspel gebyra\u00f0 on friged\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re teo\u00f0an wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0is sceal on friged\u00e6g ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0is godspel gebyra\u00f0 to m\u00e6niges confessores m\u00e6ssed\u00e6ge.\n\u00d0is godspel sceal to \u00feam ymbrenene innan h\u00e6refeste on s\u00e6ternd\u00e6g.\n\u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 on \u00fe\u00e6re nygonteo\u00f0an wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 on \u00feone \u00feryddan sunnand\u00e6g ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys godspel sceal to Sanctus hermetis and to Sanctus Agustinus m\u00e6ssan.\n\u00d0ys godspel sceal on \u00feone feor\u00f0an sunnand\u00e6g ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 on s\u00e6ternesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re o\u00f0re lencten wucan.\n\u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 on \u00fe\u00e6re teo\u00f0an wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys gebyra\u00f0 on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re teo\u00f0an ucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0is godspel gebyra\u00f0 on \u00feone o\u00f0erne sunnand\u00e6g ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 on \u00feone o\u00f0erne friged\u00e6g ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys gebyra\u00f0 on \u00fe\u00e6re syxteo\u00f0an wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys gebyra\u00f0 on \u00fe\u00e6re endlyftan wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys godspel sceal on Sancte Gregorius m\u00e6ssed\u00e6g.\n\u00d0ys gebyra\u00f0 feower wucon \u00e6r middan wyntra and on palm sunnand\u00e6g.\n\u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 on \u00fe\u00e6re endlyftan wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys godspel sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys godspell gebyra\u00f0 on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re xi ucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 on friged\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re endleftan wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0es passio gebyra\u00f0 on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re palm wucan.\n\u00d0ys gebyra\u00f0 on o\u00f0erne easterd\u00e6g.\n\u00d0ys gebyra\u00f0 on \u00feryddan easterd\u00e6g.",
